WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:04.337
This has been the best 
Christmas with you guys.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.881
Let's make Christmas Eve 
dinner our tradition.

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:09.092
I think I speak for our family

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.261
when I say we are in.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.304
Everyone say pumpkin cheesecake!

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.641
In the town of North Pole, 

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.268
we know how to do Christmas.

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:19.728
And for me and my best friend,

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:23.189
there is no competition.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.274
You're Trish and Diana, 

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.817
the unstoppable duo who wins the

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:28.069
home decorating contest every Christmas.

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:29.988
Diana is the yin to my yang. 

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:32.866
But when the whole season
 is about going over the top.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.576
I have held this title for ten years. 

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.120
I'm not letting someone else
 take it from me now. 

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.456
I just feel like you're always pushing me. 

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.707
What is that supposed to mean?

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.042
It's not always about winning.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.293
It's easy to go too far.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.587
Oh my god!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.921
Please tell me you got that.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.507
Oh, btw

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.384
we are no longer on 
speaking terms with the Riveras.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.595
If our moms break up,
 they're gonna be on us even more. 

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:54.554
I've got an idea. 

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.806
- Hey guys.
- Look who's here?

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.141
Look at all of us!

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.559
Like the good old days!

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.645
You are so not winning
 that golden reindeer this year.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.147
Who's going to stop me? 

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:04.731
I am.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.484
I have to show Diana
 that I could win without her.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.944
A supermodel snow woman. 

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:11.529
Is that my swimsuit? 

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.697
So good.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.785
Men and women hanging out
 after eight on a weekend is a date.

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:19.245
Well, we should wrap this up fast then.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:22.165
It's hard because
 she's always been there for me.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:23.249
We were a team. 

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.918
Our moms will kill us.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.920
Do not bring up our moms or...

00:01:29.547 --> 00:01:31.758
She just got pegged by Santa!

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.554
Mrs. Logan, 
I really need that reindeer. 

00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:37.639
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:39.057
This is for my granddaughter. 

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.266
Mrs. Logan!

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.352
Where is your holiday spirit?

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:48.525
No! 

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.776
This town is ruthless.

